tSize=11;fontColor=#9aa0b4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" value="Publishing a placement creates an allocated BookingOccurrence, tied to its companions by a BookingLink. A placed request is frozen unless the person cancels. Required companion: a Hold is taken when the request is made, or the companion joins the waitlist if none is free." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="470" width="1100" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
